<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia raises 31.2 mln dinars in negotiable bonds.</title>
<headline>Tunisia raises 31.2 mln dinars in negotiable bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised 31.2 million dinars from May's issue of treasury bonds negotiable at the bourse (BTNB).</p>
<p>Herewith breakdown of the issue's results (amounts in million dinars, coupon rates in pct):</p>
<p>		     May/amount  May/rate  Apr/amount   Apr/rate</p>
<p>-Five-year/equal annual tranches</p>
<p>			  0.2	7.9000	  3	  7.9000</p>
<p>			 13.5	8.0000	  1	  8.0000</p>
<p>			  5	  8.1000	  -	  -</p>
<p>-Ten-year/equal annual tranches</p>
<p>			  3	  8.5000	  7.35     9.0000</p>
<p>			  0.5	8.6500	  -	  -</p>
<p>			  9	  8.7500	  -	  -</p>
<p>Bids for May's issue amounted to 47.75 million dinars at between 7.9000 and 10.000 percent, against 64.53 million dinars in April at 7.9000 to 10.25 percent.</p>
<p>BTNB are issued each month on the first Tuesday.</p>
<p>($=1.09 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
